  "description": "At five years old, I first met Sang-Eon at my parents' funeral and began living together. At fourteen, I started my unrequited love. At twenty, I confessed while drunk, and miraculously, my crush was reciprocated. I thought I'd live happily ever after with my tender, perfect fifteen-years-older lover. At twenty-seven, I saw Sang-Eon in a place I shouldn't have.\n\n *“...Explain. From the beginning. Everything.”*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
